      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïrï nyu Apiya, ketïpchï nyinte kanasyanta Daudi, kuker werïnyi Asa kïpayta koro Yuda. Kïtöpö koro Yuda ompö kalya ompö könyis taman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigha Asa nyo karam nko man ompö tawu ECHOTYON Tororötïnyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kingany ato kïpelo amörostin ompö tororötin walak nko wölo kïsogho körkeyïntin akï tïwu koghay tïlil akïtör wölo kighyongo Asyera.* ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akïmwochï Yuda kïyar ECHOTYON Tororöt pö papotïnekwa akïrïp kirurutkö nko kiyomisutkachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinategha wölo kïsogho körkeyïntin nko ato kïpelo amörostin cho ngutoy cho onyïn ompö kanastina Yuda akitïng koro Yuda kalya osiswo paytaghtanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitek nïyet kuwik kanastina Yuda ompöwölo kimi kalya korenyi. Kimöminye poryot nyo kiporyö pipö Yuda könyiswechoni. Ompöwölo kitö ECHOTYON payasat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimwochï Asa pipö Yuda lö, “Keteka kanastinechï aketek nïyet cho koghöch kïpa yïm nko wölo kïmörörisyegho nko kukot cho echön nko möröw, tökïnyincha kore ompöwölo kikeyaracha machata ECHOTYON Tororötïnyo akikïkonecha kalya ompö woptine löwïr.” Kïteksyö akïsïkönon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitïng Asa pipö lïk 300,000 cho pö Yuda cho kitïng longoy nko ngötwö nko pipö lïk walak cho pö Penchamen 280,000 cho kipöy longoy akiwutïtoy kotï, choni löwïr kï ki mïrön pö poryot cho owesöch.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïsetyï Sera nyo pö Etopya kïpar kegh nko chane kungwïn nko lïk nyo pö mïrön cho makïrar nko nkaritin 300, kingwïn ntökwitï Maresya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïwö Asa kuryam nko nyinte, kïtat lïkengwa kïtïpï kïpsach ompö mpöghoghyo Sepata nyo mi Maresya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlokyï Asa ECHOTYON Tororötïnyi lö, “ECHOTYON, möminye chi nyo lata nyi nyo ngöroköy cho nyarkalal ompö kwenu cho tïng owesyö. Ngarakecha, we ECHOTYON Tororötïnyo, ompöwölo kitwoytonecha kegh nyi kakïpkanacha kepar kegh nko söpïchï wöw le nyï ompö kaynengu. We ECHOTYON, ichinyi Tororötïncha. Mekany kïkwol kegh ptangengmöt ompö tawungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona kïrïnta ECHOTYON pipö Etopya kïsïwïyi Asa nko pipö Yuda, kiryagh pipö Etopya nyoman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïrïp Asa nko lïkenyi pïchoni ntö kurel Kerar, kikïpar pipö Etopya amöminye nyo le ompö akong nyo kichïwït, ompöwölo kikingïr chane ompö tawu Tororöt nko ompö tawuto pikachi, kikasan pipö Yuda tïkwïn cho chang cho kipïtö pïchoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kipar kunyar kanastin löwïr cho kiwit Kerar ompöwölo kingwïnchï otyogh pö Tororöt pich cho kimöngöy kanastinechoni. Kingagh kanastine tïkwïl, ompöwölo kimi tïkwïn cho chang ori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kipar ngat kestoni pich cho kitïng kyak akïrany kechir nko ngaror cho chang nko tamasay, atolapay kïmïlisyö kutang Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Keyokwï Asa saghata man",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
